  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "Bolt path, branch count, spark spray and shake strength change per cast. Timing is fixed so it lines up with gameplay hit frames."
  },
  "director_notes": "Long gather vs. 70 ms strike gives weight. Restrike flicker is the signature of natural lightning. Main bolt stays solid (regen_ms 0) so it reads as one strike, while crackles regenerate fast to feel alive. Ground marks: a dark scorch (alpha) that stays after the spell, with glowing cracks (add) on top that cool within half a second, so the hit reads from above and leaves a mark."
